none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="margin-left: 5px;"><path d="M16 1H4C2.9 1 2 1.9 2 3V17H4V3H16V1ZM20 5H8C6.9 5 6 5.9 6 7V21C6 22.1 6.9 23 8 23H20C21.1 23 22 22.1 22 21V7C22 5.9 21.1 5 20 5ZM20 21H8V7H20V21Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></button><span style="margin-top: 5px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 0.875rem; color: black;">Claim Tool</span></div></div></div></div></div></section><nav class="sticky top-[97px] z-40 bg-white border-b border-tools-border transition-shadow duration-150 "><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="flex gap-1 overflow-x-auto scrollbar-hide py-2"><button class="px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium rounded-md whitespace-nowrap transition-colors duration-100 bg-tools-accent text-white">Overview</button><button class="px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium rounded-md whitespace-nowrap transition-colors duration-100 text-tools-muted hover:text-tools-text hover:bg-tools-bg">Pricing</button><button class="px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium rounded-md whitespace-nowrap transition-colors duration-100 text-tools-muted hover:text-tools-text hover:bg-tools-bg">Reviews</button><button class="px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium rounded-md whitespace-nowrap transition-colors duration-100 text-tools-muted hover:text-tools-text hover:bg-tools-bg">FAQ</button></div></div></nav><section id="overview" class="py-12 bg-white"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="mb-10"><h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold text-tools-text mb-4">What is text-to-cad?</h2><div class="relative max-w-4xl"><p class="text-tools-muted leading-relaxed whitespace-pre-line" style="max-height: 16rem; overflow: hidden;">text-to-cad is an open-source CAD plugin for AI coding agents. It gives Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Gemini, Grok, OpenCode, Windsurf, Zed, VS Code, and other compatible assistants a practical way to create CAD artifacts from natural-language instructions. The project README says it can generate STEP, GLB, STL, and 3MF files, run design-for-manufacturing checks, create engineering drawings, and connect work to 3D printing, sheet metal, and CNC fabrication services.

The setup paths are concrete. Claude Code users can add the earthtojake marketplace and install the plugin. Codex users can add the same marketplace after upgrading to a recent Codex release. Claude Desktop users can run the cadgen MCP server through uvx, which gives the assistant a local CAD process and viewer flow. The repository also documents Cursor and other clients, so teams can use the tool in the editor or terminal agent they already use instead of moving the whole task to a separate CAD environment.

The value is speed during early hardware and product exploration. A builder can describe a bracket, enclosure, fixture, adapter, or visual mockup, then inspect the generated model before asking the agent for another pass. That does not replace mechanical engineering review, tolerance checks, material selection, regulatory review, or safety validation. It does make the first sketch and handoff faster, especially for software-heavy teams that already live in AI-assisted development workflows.

text-to-cad is strongest when the problem can be described clearly in words and the expected output is a prototype, example, or starting geometry file. It is weaker when the work depends on precise manufacturing tolerances that have not been specified. The README also notes that CAD runtime components may download on first launch, so setup needs a working network connection.

Pricing is simple: the project is MIT licensed and open source. Users still need their chosen agent, uv or uvx, and any paid model or fabrication services they decide to connect. For OpenTools readers, the important point is that text-to-cad turns agent chat into inspectable CAD files instead of leaving hardware ideas as loose text. It is a focused bridge between coding-agent workflows and physical-product prototyping, with enough documented setup detail to test quickly. The current repository also shows active attention to agent-specific installation notes, which matters because CAD generation only becomes useful when the surrounding assistant can install, call, view, and revise the generated artifacts without a brittle manual handoff during early design reviews.</p><div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 h-8 bg-gradient-to-t from-white to-transparent pointer-events-none"></div></div><button class="mt-2 text-sm font-medium text-tools-accent hover:text-tools-accent-hover transition-colors">Read more</button></div><div class="mb-10"><div><h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-tools-text mb-2">text-to-cad's Top Features</h2><p class="text-tools-muted mb-8">Key capabilities that make text-to-cad stand out.</p><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4"><div class="bg-white border border-tools-border rounded-lg p-4 hover:border-tools-border-hover transition-shadow flex items-start gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="h-6 w-6 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M2.25 12c0-5.385 4.365-9.75 9.75-9.75s9.75 4.365 9.75 9.75-4.365 9.75-9.75 9.75S2.25 17.385 2.25 12Zm13.36-1.814a.75.75 0 1 0-1.22-.872l-3.236 4.53L9.53 12.22a.75.75 0 0 0-1.06 1.06l2.25 2.25a.75.75 0 0 0 1.14-.094l3.75-5.25Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg><p class="text-tools-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">Generates STEP, GLB, STL, and 3MF model files</p></div><div class="bg-white border border-tools-border rounded-lg p-4 hover:border-tools-border-hover transition-shadow flex items-start gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="h-6 w-6 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M2.25 12c0-5.385 4.365-9.75 9.75-9.75s9.75 4.365 9.75 9.75-4.365 9.75-9.75 9.75S2.25 17.385 2.25 12Zm13.36-1.814a.75.75 0 1 0-1.22-.872l-3.236 4.53L9.53 12.22a.75.75 0 0 0-1.06 1.06l2.25 2.25a.75.75 0 0 0 1.14-.094l3.75-5.25Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg><p class="text-tools-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">Supports Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Gemini, Grok, OpenCode, Windsurf, Zed, VS Code, and other clients</p></div><div class="bg-white border border-tools-border rounded-lg p-4 hover:border-tools-border-hover transition-shadow flex items-start gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="h-6 w-6 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M2.25 12c0-5.385 4.365-9.75 9.75-9.75s9.75 4.365 9.75 9.75-4.365 9.75-9.75 9.75S2.25 17.385 2.25 12Zm13.36-1.814a.75.75 0 1 0-1.22-.872l-3.236 4.53L9.53 12.22a.75.75 0 0 0-1.06 1.06l2.25 2.25a.75.75 0 0 0 1.14-.094l3.75-5.25Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg><p class="text-tools-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">Runs CAD workflows locally through cadgen and uv or uvx</p></div><div class="bg-white border border-tools-border rounded-lg p-4 hover:border-tools-border-hover transition-shadow flex items-start gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="h-6 w-6 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M2.25 12c0-5.385 4.365-9.75 9.75-9.75s9.75 4.365 9.75 9.75-4.365 9.75-9.75 9.75S2.25 17.385 2.25 12Zm13.36-1.814a.75.75 0 1 0-1.22-.872l-3.236 4.53L9.53 12.22a.75.75 0 0 0-1.06 1.06l2.25 2.25a.75.75 0 0 0 1.14-.094l3.75-5.25Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg><p class="text-tools-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">Includes design-for-manufacturing checks and engineering drawing generation</p></div><div class="bg-white border border-tools-border rounded-lg p-4 hover:border-tools-border-hover transition-shadow flex items-start gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="h-6 w-6 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M2.25 12c0-5.385 4.365-9.75 9.75-9.75s9.75 4.365 9.75 9.75-4.365 9.75-9.75 9.75S2.25 17.385 2.25 12Zm13.36-1.814a.75.75 0 1 0-1.22-.872l-3.236 4.53L9.53 12.22a.75.75 0 0 0-1.06 1.06l2.25 2.25a.75.75 0 0 0 1.14-.094l3.75-5.25Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg><p class="text-tools-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">Shows generated models through viewer cards or browser links where supported</p></div></div></div></div><div class="mb-10"><div><h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-display font-bold text-tools-text mb-2">Use Cases</h2><p class="text-tools-muted mb-8">Who benefits most from this tool.</p><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6"><div class="bg-tools-surface border border-tools-border rounded-lg p-6 hover:border-tools-border-hover transition-colors"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-tools-accent mb-2"><a class="hover:text-tools-accent-hover transition-colors" href="/use-cases/builders-prototyping-physical-products">Builders prototyping physical products</a></h3><p class="text-tools-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">Generate quick printable models, housings, brackets, fixtures, or mockups from an AI agent conversation.</p></div><div class="bg-tools-surface border border-tools-border rounded-lg p-6 hover:border-tools-border-hover transition-colors"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-tools-accent mb-2"><a class="hover:text-tools-accent-hover transition-colors" href="/use-cases/coding-agent-power-users">Coding-agent power users</a></h3><p class="text-tools-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">Add a CAD workflow to Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, and similar clients without switching tools.</p></div><div class="bg-tools-surface border border-tools-border rounded-lg p-6 hover:border-tools-border-hover transition-colors"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-tools-accent mb-2"><a class="hover:text-tools-accent-hover transition-colors" href="/use-cases/hardware-teams-validating-early-ideas">Hardware teams validating early ideas</a></h3><p class="text-tools-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">Create model files and drawings before a specialist CAD review.</p></div></div><div class="mt-8 text-center"><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-medium text-tools-accent hover:text-tools-accent-hover" href="/use-cases">Explore Top AI Use Cases<svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></div><div class="mb-6"><div><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-tools-text mb-3">Tags</h3><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"><span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm font-medium bg-tools-accent-light text-tools-accent">cad</span><span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm font-medium bg-tools-accent-light text-tools-accent">3d-modeling</span><span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm font-medium bg-tools-accent-light text-tools-accent">agent-tools</span><span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm font-medium bg-tools-accent-light text-tools-accent">claude-code</span><span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm font-medium bg-tools-accent-light text-tools-accent">codex</span><span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm font-medium bg-tools-accent-light text-tools-accent">mcp</span><span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm font-medium bg-tools-accent-light text-tools-accent">3d-printing</span><span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm font-medium bg-tools-accent-light text-tools-accent">developer-tools</span><span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm font-medium bg-tools-accent-light text-tools-accent">open-source</span><span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm font-medium bg-tools-accent-light text-tools-accent">fabrication</span></div></div></div></div></section><section id="pricing" class="py-12 bg-white border-t border-tools-border"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div id="pricing-container" class="mt-10 border-t border-tools-border pt-10"><div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-8 flex-wrap gap-4"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-tools-text">text-to-cad's Pricing</h2><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-xs font-medium bg-green-50 text-green-700 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-green-200">Free plan available</span></div></div><div class="mt-6"><div class="grid gap-4 grid-cols-4"><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="rounded-lg border p-6 shadow-sm h-full flex flex-col border-green-300 bg-green-50/30"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><h3 id="Open source-0" class="text-lg font-semibold text-tools-text">Open source</h3><span class="text-xs font-medium bg-green-100 text-green-700 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">Free</span></div><p class="mt-4 flex items-baseline"><span class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-tools-text">Free</span></p><ul class="mt-6 space-y-4 flex-grow"><li class="flex items-start"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="h-6 w-5 flex-shrink-0 text-green-500"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 0 1 .143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 0 1 1.05-.143Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg><span class="ml-3 text-sm text-tools-muted">Open-source repository</span></li><li class="flex items-start"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="h-6 w-5 flex-shrink-0 text-green-500"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 0 1 .143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 0 1 1.05-.143Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg><span class="ml-3 text-sm text-tools-muted">Self-hosted or local setup</span></li><li class="flex items-start"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="h-6 w-5 flex-shrink-0 text-green-500"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 0 1 .143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 0 1 1.05-.143Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg><span class="ml-3 text-sm text-tools-muted">Bring your own AI runtime</span></li></ul><a href="https://github.com/earthtojake/text-to-cad?utm_source=opentools_web&amp;utm_medium=opentools-tool-open-source" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="mt-8 block w-full rounded-md bg-tools-accent px-3 py-2 text-center text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-sm hover:bg-tools-accent-hover focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-tools-accent ph-no-capture">Get started</a></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-12 bg-white border-t border-tools-border"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="mt-8"></div></div></section><section id="reviews" class="py-12 bg-white border-t border-tools-border"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div><div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-4 py-16"><div class=""><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-tools-text">User Reviews</h2><div class="mt-10"><h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-tools-text">Share your thoughts</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-tools-muted">If you've used this product, share your thoughts with other builders</p><form class="mt-6"><div class=