 15.591l4.069 2.485c.713.436 1.598-.207 1.404-1.02l-1.106-4.637 3.62-3.102c.635-.544.297-1.584-.536-1.65l-4.752-.382-1.831-4.401Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="text-tools-border h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0 cursor-pointer"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10.868 2.884c-.321-.772-1.415-.772-1.736 0l-1.83 4.401-4.753.381c-.833.067-1.171 1.107-.536 1.651l3.62 3.102-1.106 4.637c-.194.813.691 1.456 1.405 1.02L10 15.591l4.069 2.485c.713.436 1.598-.207 1.404-1.02l-1.106-4.637 3.62-3.102c.635-.544.297-1.584-.536-1.65l-4.752-.382-1.831-4.401Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></div></div><input type="hidden" value="0" name="rating"><textarea class="w-full rounded-md border border-tools-border px-3 py-2 text-sm text-tools-text" placeholder="Write your review here..." rows="4"></textarea><button type="submit" class="mt-4 inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center rounded-md border border-transparent bg-tools-accent px-8 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-white hover:bg-tools-accent-hover sm:w-auto lg:w-full">Submit Review</button></form></div><div class="mt-16"><h3 class="sr-only">Recent reviews</h3><div class="flow-root"><div class="-my-12 divide-y divide-gray-200"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="faq" class="py-12 bg-white border-t border-tools-border"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6"><h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold text-tools-text">Frequently Asked Questions</h2></div><div class="max-w-4xl space-y-4"><details class="group bg-tools-bg rounded-lg border border-tools-border"><summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer p-4 text-sm font-medium text-tools-text hover:text-tools-accent"><span class="flex items-center gap-2">What does text-to-cad generate?</span><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-tools-muted group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg></summary><div class="px-4 pb-4 text-sm text-tools-muted leading-relaxed"><span>The README says it can generate STEP, GLB, STL, and 3MF files, plus manufacturing checks and drawings.</span></div></details><details class="group bg-tools-bg rounded-lg border border-tools-border"><summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer p-4 text-sm font-medium text-tools-text hover:text-tools-accent"><span class="flex items-center gap-2">Which agent clients can use it?</span><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-tools-muted group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg></summary><div class="px-4 pb-4 text-sm text-tools-muted leading-relaxed"><span>The project documents Claude Code, Claude Desktop, Codex, Cursor, Gemini, Grok, OpenCode, Windsurf, Zed, VS Code, and other clients.</span></div></details><details class="group bg-tools-bg rounded-lg border border-tools-border"><summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer p-4 text-sm font-medium text-tools-text hover:text-tools-accent"><span class="flex items-center gap-2">Is text-to-cad free?</span><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-tools-muted group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg></summary><div class="px-4 pb-4 text-sm text-tools-muted leading-relaxed"><span>The repository is MIT licensed. Users still need their agent, uv/uvx, and any paid services they connect.</span></div></details></div><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What does text-to-cad generate?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The README says it can generate STEP, GLB, STL, and 3MF files, plus manufacturing checks and drawings."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which agent clients can use it?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The project documents Claude Code, Claude Desktop, Codex, Cursor, Gemini, Grok, OpenCode, Windsurf, Zed, VS Code, and other clients."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is text-to-cad free?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The repository is MIT licensed. Users still need their agent, uv/uvx, and any paid services they connect."}}]}</script></div></section><footer class="bg-gray-900" aria-labelledby="footer-heading"><h2 id="footer-heading" class="sr-only">Footer</h2><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-16"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-5 gap-8"><div class="md:col-span-1 space-y-8"><a href="/"><img alt="Company name" loading="lazy" width="120" height="24" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-6 cursor-pointer" src="/opentools-logo-red.svg" style="color: transparent;"></a><p class="text-sm leading-6 text-gray-400">The right AI tool is out there. We'll help you find it.</p><div class="flex space-x-6"><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/opentools/" class="text-gray-400 hover:text-white"><span class="sr-only">LinkedIn</span><svg fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-6 w-6" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M 18.25 3 L 5.75 3 C 4.234375 3 3 4.234375 3 5.75 L 3 18.25 C 3 19.765625 4.234375 21 5.75 21 L 18.25 21 C 19.765625 21 21 19.765625 21 18.25 L 21 5.75 C 21 4.234375 19.765625 3 18.25 3 Z M 9 17 C 9 17.277344 8.777344 17.5 8.5 17.5 L 7 17.5 C 6.722656 17.5 6.5 17.277344 6.5 17 L 6.5 10.5 C 6.5 10.222656 6.722656 10 7 10 L 8.5 10 C 8.777344 10 9 10.222656 9 10.5 Z M 7.75 9 C 7.058594 9 6.5 8.441406 6.5 7.75 C 6.5 7.058594 7.058594 6.5 7.75 6.5 C 8.441406 6.5 9 7.058594 9 7.75 C 9 8.441406 8.441406 9 7.75 9 Z M 17.5 17 C 17.5 17.277344 17.277344 17.5 17 17.5 L 15.5 17.5 C 15.222656 17